{"id":"vod_md_7625","vodId":"7625","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"爆上战队奔奔者","name_cn":"爆上战队奔奔者","date":"2024-01-01","year":"2024","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第14集","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20240307-1/f027b0f320c40b44702ab42c826dbffd.jpg"},"summary":"范道大也因为他独到的创意和压倒性的机械工程知识技术，名声大噪。某一天，大也与来自宇宙的车型机器人“奔多里奥·奔德拉斯”相遇了。机器人的昵称是“奔奔”，两人机缘巧合之下住在了一起。就在此时，袭击了不同星球的大宇宙侵略大走力团“哈袭利安”直属干部突然来袭！他们为了从人类的悲鸣中收取能量“泣油”，将地球选做了下一个目标。大也和情报收集专家鸣田射士郎，专业驾驶员志布户未来一起组成了奔奔者！在此之后，阿久赖锭和振骑玄蕃也加入进来，5人一起同来自宇宙的威胁“哈袭利安”战斗。巧妙自如地驾驭车辆，由英雄自己创造超级机械，变形并与机器人合体进行抗争！勇猛无敌的超前卫英雄诞生！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动作,科幻,冒险"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-06-04 06:45:56","episodeCount":14,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240303/M1qg69fl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240316/cmMeRJli/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240317/oPHml0G4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240324/4V3jVB0U/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240331/jBME2rm1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240407/rY3DEyOm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240414/aGeH7nkZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240421/Um9PxMLj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240505/Ud7sb4Xp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx12.com/20240603/xuUvPawI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240519/SCEgcOKG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx12.com/20240603/ThXJGTsY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx12.com/20240603/17DVIOIB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx12.com/20240603/5EyjVSs7/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:27.217Z"}